{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25241","headline":"赋得琢玉成器 · 浩虚舟","name":"赋得琢玉成器","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已沐识坚贞，应怜器未成。\n辉山方可重，散璞乍堪惊。\n玷灭随心正，瑕消夺眼明。\n琢磨虹气在，拂拭水容生。\n赏翫冰光冷，提携月魄轻。\n伫当亲捧握，瑚琏幸齐名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"浩虚舟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}